# androdr-050 is a patch-level (device_posture) rule: EXPOSED, never DETECTED (Q9-3).
# Requires a patch level old enough that the rule's CVEs are unpatched. In a --load run
# with graphite_dns_attribution the Graphite row is DETECTED (DETECTED outranks
# EXPOSED), so the EXPOSED lines can only hold without it.
[!!]  Graphite (Paragon): EXPOSED --
~\[!!\]  Graphite \(Paragon\): EXPOSED -- [0-9]+ CVEs linked to Graphite \(unpatched; not evidence of infection\)
# A CVE rule must never read as DETECTED.
!~Graphite \(Paragon\): DETECTED -- .*CVEs linked to
